              heading: 'Part 5',
              text: 'Choose any five gentle and vigorous movements, from the above animal and nature movements. Let Group demonstrate gentle movements, and Group demonstrate vigorous movements. The groups then switch and create different movements to show vigorous and gentle qualities. Activity 16.5 Bansuri • Grade Dance.indd Dance.indd Learning Outcomes Teacher Self Understands the different parts of feet that are used in dance Able to follow the dance steps Shows effort to learn the dance steps and movement qualities Makes the prop with effort and imagination and uses it in dance ASSESSMENT — : Creating My Dance Competencies : CG – C-3.1, C-3.2 Teacher’s feedback on student’s strengths Teacher’s feedback on areas of improvement Any other observation Dance Dance.indd Dance.indd',
